                <mxCell id="1 s35" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;How the services talk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Only through events on one topic, and through Supabase state. No service calls another directly.&lt;br&gt;• Each worker reads and writes Supabase (status, fields, flags, runs, risk) and publishes its result back to the topic.&lt;br&gt;• Every event is also an audit row, stored once by audit-metrics (redeliveries ignored by event id).&lt;br&gt;• Status changes are compare-and-swap, so a repeated event can&#39;t apply twice. Only Pub/Sub&#39;s identity can invoke a worker.&lt;br&gt;• One codebase, one Dockerfile with a build target per role (shared layers); ROLE picks what each service runs." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="140" width="900" x="40" y="810" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
