                <mxCell id="4 s15" value="&lt;b&gt;Seen in&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;audit trail · Pipeline dashboard (stuck now,&lt;br&gt;recovered, gave up) · email alert on give-up&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
