                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="4 s22" value="&lt;b&gt;Also handled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Worker dies mid-push → Pub/Sub redelivers (ack deadline 600 s); after 5 attempts → dead-letter + email alert.&lt;br&gt;• Officer cancels a run on another instance → the run polls the audit trail / its status every 5 s and stops.&lt;br&gt;• Publishing an approval fails → the approval is undone and the officer sees an error (nothing left half-done)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
